@startuml
' SET09803 DevOps Coursework - Requirement 30 Use Case Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Data Researcher" as Researcher
rectangle "Database System" as DB << System >>

rectangle "World Population Reporting System" {
    usecase "Retrieve District Population" as UC_DistrictPopulation
    usecase "Validate District" as UC_ValidateDistrict
    usecase "Query District Population Data" as UC_QueryDistrict
    usecase "Display Error Message" as UC_Error
}

' Primary Actor Interactions
Researcher --> UC_DistrictPopulation

' Sub-task dependencies (Includes)
UC_DistrictPopulation .> UC_ValidateDistrict : <<include>>
UC_DistrictPopulation .> UC_QueryDistrict : <<include>>

' System Actor Interactions
UC_QueryDistrict --> DB

' Failure Extension
UC_DistrictPopulation <.. UC_Error : <<extend>>\n(Invalid District or\nDatabase Failure)

' Notes
note right of UC_DistrictPopulation
  Retrieves the population
  of a selected district for
  local administrative analysis
end note

note right of UC_QueryDistrict
  Queries the population value
  for the selected district
  from the database
end note

note bottom of UC_Error
  Triggered if the district
  is invalid, MySQL database
  is unreachable, or required
  population data is missing
end note

@enduml